    safetyImpact: { en: "The unresolved case demonstrated the need for better in-flight evidence, helping show why flight-data recording and more systematic component tracking were essential.", zh: "这一未能查明原因的案例表明需要更充分的空中证据，也说明飞行数据记录和更系统的部件追踪为何至关重要。" },
