    route: { en: "San Diego → New York (via Los Angeles and Chicago)", zh: "圣迭戈 → 纽约（经洛杉矶和芝加哥）" }, location: { en: "Near Mount Carmel, Pennsylvania, United States", zh: "美国宾夕法尼亚州卡梅尔山附近" }, agency: "CAB",
    summary: { en: "A false cargo-fire warning prompted the crew to discharge carbon-dioxide extinguishers and begin an emergency descent. The required pressure-relief controls were not opened, allowing extinguisher gas to enter the occupied spaces and impair the crew.", zh: "错误的货舱火警促使机组释放二氧化碳灭火剂并紧急下降。由于未开启规定的泄压装置，灭火气体进入人员区域并影响机组状态。" },
    findings: [{ en: "Post-accident examination found no evidence of an actual in-flight fire.", zh: "事后检查未发现真实空中火灾证据。" }, { en: "The fire-extinguisher procedure depended on manual pressure-relief steps.", zh: "灭火程序依赖人工完成泄压步骤。" }, { en: "The crew was probably impaired by a high concentration of extinguisher gas.", zh: "机组很可能受到高浓度灭火气体影响。" }],
    safetyImpact: { en: "The case drove safer fire-extinguishing and ventilation procedures and showed why emergency checklists must account for workload and human error.", zh: "该事故推动改进灭火与通风程序，并说明紧急检查单必须考虑高工作负荷和人为失误。" },
