    chartNote: { en: "Known cruise altitude shown schematically; the final motion is unknown because no recorder or main wreckage was recovered.", zh: "图中仅示意已知巡航高度；由于没有记录器或主体残骸，最后运动状态未知。" }, image: dc4ArchiveImage,
