    summary: { en: "While the DC-4 climbed southbound, it collided with a U.S. Navy SNB training aircraft operating near Key West. Investigators reconstructed the converging tracks and examined traffic coordination and visual lookout.", zh: "DC-4向南爬升时，与一架在基韦斯特附近训练的美国海军SNB飞机相撞。调查人员重建了交汇航迹，并分析交通协调和目视观察。" },
