    summary: { en: "While descending toward Nice at night near local storms, the Constellation continued into high terrain at Mont Le Cimet. The aircraft remained under control before terrain contact.", zh: "星座客机夜间在局部风暴附近下降前往尼斯时，继续飞入勒西梅山高地。飞机在接触地形前仍处于可控状态。" },
