    summary: { en: "Soon after departure, Flight 694 collided with a privately operated Douglas DC-3 flying toward Cincinnati. The CAB reconstructed the converging tracks and examined traffic control, position reporting and visual separation.", zh: "694号班机起飞后不久，与一架飞往辛辛那提的私人运营DC-3相撞。CAB重建了两机交汇航迹，并调查空中交通管制、位置报告和目视间隔。" },
