    summary: { en: "During approach to Manchester in poor weather, a flap-system fault produced an asymmetric configuration. Control was lost while the crew attempted to continue the approach.", zh: "飞机在恶劣天气中进近曼彻斯特时，襟翼系统故障造成不对称构型。机组尝试继续进近期间失去控制。" },
