    safetyImpact: { en: "The investigation led to attention on flap-drive integrity, asymmetry protection and crew procedures for abnormal high-lift configurations.", zh: "调查推动改进襟翼驱动完整性、不对称保护以及机组处置异常增升装置构型的程序。" },
